<title>UK: Cruden Bay to buy services company Kenton.</title>
<headline>Cruden Bay to buy services company Kenton.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment trust Cruden Bay said on Wednesday it is to buy engineering services firm Kenton for up to 21.4 million stg.</p>
</text>
